# Learn from mistakes (Cursor lessons)

**Store:** `.cursor/context/lessons.md` (max 15 active; archive in `lessons-archive.md`)

## When to grep (do not read whole file unless hits)

| Task type | Command |
|---|---|
| Infra / cache / queue / CI proposals | `node .cursor/scripts/session-lesson-cursor.js grep "infra\|cache\|redis"` |
| New vendor API or FMP endpoint | `grep -i "fmp\|vendor" .cursor/context/lessons.md` |
| PM backlog or "implement the plan" | `grep -i "task\|audit\|scope" .cursor/context/lessons.md` |
| Catalysts / analyst / breakdown | `grep -i "catalyst\|analyst" .cursor/context/lessons.md` |

## When to add a lesson (session wrap)

Only if **user corrected us** or **codebase evidence** disproved an assumption — and the fix is a repeatable guardrail.

```bash
node .cursor/scripts/session-lesson-cursor.js add \
  --title "..." --trigger "..." --mistake "..." --fix "..." [--verify "..."]
node .cursor/scripts/session-wrap-cursor.js "summary" --lessons L-YYYY-MM-DD-NN
```

**Do not** add lessons for style, typos, or anything already in `data-agent.md` / existing rules.

## Context budget

- sessionStart banner: last 2 **Fix** lines only (via rehydrate)
- Full lesson bodies: read only matching entries after grep
- Never promote lessons to `alwaysApply` rules without user approval
